e":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"P7iCMgY9tI0","position":31,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bobby Valentino - Slow Down (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"hUpK2ln00EE","path":"/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/slow-down-instrumental/","slug":"slow-down-instrumental","title":"Slow Down (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"bobby-valentino","title":"Bobby Valentino"},"artwork":"images/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/slow-down-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"p1G05rzP_zI","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Bobby Valentino - Anonymous (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"VAqu72JJaBw","path":"/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/anonymous-instrumental/","slug":"anonymous-instrumental","title":"Anonymous (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"bobby-valentino","title":"Bobby Valentino"},"artwork":"images/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/anonymous-instrumental.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"EVMFTD6oGnE","slug":"180","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/radio-show-180-w-hannah-faith"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #180 w/ Hannah Faith","artwork":"/images/episodes/180.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10759,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Kk6jqRE7-ps","position":5,"timestamp":"01:28:30","rawTrack":"Bobby Valentino - Anonymous (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"VAqu72JJaBw","path":"/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/anonymous-instrumental/","slug":"anonymous-instrumental","title":"Anonymous (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"bobby-valentino","title":"Bobby Valentino"},"artwork":"images/artists/bobby-valentino/tracks/anonymous-instrumental.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"RZtsdfDAG2Q","slug":"181","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-181-w-chris-mcclenney-the-whooligan"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #181 w/ Chris McClenney & The Whooliga